  add_requirement,studio-rag-through-registry,"Studio retrieval MUST go through the unified RAG registry","studio 生成检索 MUST 通过统一 ragRegistry.retrieveWith 走 embed/fusion/diversity 路径，MUST NOT 用原始文本 slice 截断（对齐 qa/outputs/refine 的检索路径一致性）",null,null,null
